### Basket co-occurrence: say that I bought "whole milk" already.
### Which other products appear most often in baskets that contain it?
### Note: the top group is "whole milk" itself (it's in every matching basket),
### so we ask for 4 groups — the next 3 are the recommendations.
POST https://<mTLS_ENDPOINT_DNS_GOES_HERE>/search/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hits": 1,
  "select": {
    "where": {
      "contains": [
        "items",
        "whole milk"
      ]
    },
    "grouping": [
      {
        "all": {
          "group": "items",
          "max": 4,
          "order": "-count()",
          "each": {
            "output": "count()"
          }
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}

### The same query, with grouping in YQL, for the terminal:
# vespa query 'yql=select * from basket where items contains "whole milk" | all(group(items) max(4) order(-count()) each(output(count())))' hits=1
